{"synopsis":"Para “Perusak” adalah monster yang lahir dari sampah yang dimuntahkan umat manusia ke dunia, dan keberadaan mereka perlahan-lahan menggerogoti planet ini, mendorong umat manusia ke ambang kehancuran. Agen terkuat umat manusia, Jin Shidō, memperoleh kekuatan untuk menyelamatkan dunia setelah menjalani eksperimen brutal terhadap manusia—tetapi itu sudah terlambat; 99% umat manusia telah binasa. Menaruh harapannya pada masa depan, Jin memilih untuk memasuki tidur panjang. Seratus juta tahun kemudian, di Bumi yang baru terlahir kembali, Jin terbangun dan tersenyum. “Sepertinya aku benar untuk mempercayainya—kemungkinan-kemungkinan di masa depan.”","alternative_title":"最終兵器、1億年後に無双する","author":"HOSHITSUKI Koneko","artist":"SORAJIMA","chapters":[{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"00b0bf61-0fb2-422c-b8a2-9b86589b5368","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-07-24"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"2d03bc7d-54ae-4b5c-a0f5-da33446f9395","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-07-14"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"3a5ced0b-96f1-4da6-9059-99de65105656","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-07-07"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"76735025-430c-45c0-aacc-e6cfe647ae1a","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-06-30"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"3a5c5a2a-1699-46b6-a14f-6147fc8cb6f5","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-06-30"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"e56c8119-cd4b-4f65-b8e4-4f2ddb3ee037","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-06-19"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"6f7fb807-1744-4313-8051-b7f68cececae","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-05-17"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"4e22cd5f-cf1e-42dc-9f59-7be7ee5e8f7d","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-05-08"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"550c5b9a-00ba-44f4-8993-2916ed30cd3b","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-05-03"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"41b32bd6-6269-4611-a97d-fd263645885f","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-05-03"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"55ab9213-fff2-4bc7-